.TH COPYRIGHT 5 "November 2026" "APKGENG 1.12.7" "Amix File Formats"
.SH NAME
copyright \- a package's copyright and licence notice
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B install/copyright
.SH DESCRIPTION
A package may carry a
.B copyright
file, named in its prototype(5) as
.BR "i copyright" .
It is plain text, any number of lines, and holds the package's
copyright and licence notice.
.PP
.BR pkgadd (1M)
saves it, unchanged, as
.BI /var/sadm/pkg/ pkginst /install/copyright
and in the package's pspool copy, and from APKGENG 1.12.7 prints nothing of
it, with or without
.BR \-S .
That file is the place to read it.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
Copyright (c) 2026 Example Author.
Distributed under the MIT license; see /opt/amix/share/doc/example.
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkginfo (5),
.BR prototype (5),
.BR pkgadd (1M)
